  "label": "User projected onto the goat stereotype via the visual scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman holding the goat, which is mapped onto the derogatory 'goat' stereotype for Muslims. The meme's structure implies the user is identifying with or being mocked through this visual representation, as the scene is used to symbolize the targeted group. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the sarcastic framing and the association of the user with the absurd context (Ariana Grande, Hillary Clinton rally) create an implicit projection where the user is positioned as the one being mocked or as the one who would be associated with the stereotype.",
